{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/operator_cmp","title":"operator==,!=(std::scoped_allocator_adaptor)","titleHtml":"operator==,!=<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::scoped_allocator_adaptor)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/operator_cmp","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two scoped allocator adaptors. Two such allocators are equal if:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/scoped_allocator\">&lt;scoped_allocator&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OuterAlloc1, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OuterAlloc2, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">InnerAllocs</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> scoped_allocator_adaptor<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OuterAlloc1, InnerAllocs...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> scoped_allocator_adaptor<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OuterAlloc2, InnerAllocs...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OuterAlloc1, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OuterAlloc2, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">InnerAllocs</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> scoped_allocator_adaptor<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OuterAlloc1, InnerAllocs...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> scoped_allocator_adaptor<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OuterAlloc2, InnerAllocs...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two scoped allocator adaptors. Two such allocators are equal if:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">outer_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">outer_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, and\n</li><li> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>InnerAllocs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">inner_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">inner_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> scoped allocator adaptors to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are not equal, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==,!=(std::scoped_allocator_adaptor)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11, unti